3. Veterinary Clinical Training Center
•	A fully functional veterinary clinic within the institute to provide on-the-job training in treating animal health issues.
•	The clinic will provide free healthcare services for livestock and pets, allowing students to work with experienced veterinary doctors and para-veterinary professionals.
•	It will also serve as a first-aid and emergency care unit for injured animals, teaching students practical animal care techniques.
